<title>POLAND: ELEKTRIM AUG NET FALLS TO PLN 3.1 MLN.</title>
<headline>ELEKTRIM AUG NET FALLS TO PLN 3.1 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results August</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>AUGUST</p>
<p> Net profit	     3.06 vs   3.32</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	17.68 vs  13.07</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.63 vs  14.08</p>
<p> Sales		   64.74 vs  49.20</p>
<p>JANUARY-AUGUST</p>
<p> Net profit	    26.36 vs  20.31</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit     140.54 vs  52.53</p>
<p> Operating profit    26.29 vs  23.53</p>
<p> Sales		  571.96 vs 373.37</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish industrial and trading</p>
<p>conglomerate is Elektrim SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
